p with flexible deep pockets</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Lightweight, silky soft texture provides luxurious comfort</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Machine washable for easy maintenance</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center mt-16 cursor-pointer text-color-UIText3"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="16px"><path d="M24 6a18 18 0 1 0 0 36 18 18 0 0 0 0-36ZM2 24a22 22 0 1 1 44 0 22 22 0 0 1-44 0Zm25-8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm-4 6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V23a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2Z"></path></svg><span class="P3-Regular ml-4">This information is AI generated</span></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Details</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="background-color-UIPageGrouped3 p-16 rounded-6"><table class="table-fixed w-full border-spacing-y-12 -my-12 border-separate font-sans font-normal"><tbody><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--tux-v2-color-ui-shape-neutral-4)"><td class="w-1/2 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText2" style="font-size:16px">Brand</span></td><td class="w-1/2 pl-12 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">CGK Linens</span></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--tux-v2-color-ui-shape-neutral-4)"><td class="w-1/2 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText2" style="font-size:16px">Closure type</span></td><td class="w-1/2 pl-12 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Zipper</span></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--tux-v2-color-ui-shape-neutral-4)"><td class="w-1/2 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText2" style="font-size:16px">Sheets and pillowcases type</span></td><td class="w-1/2 pl-12 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Set</span></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--tux-v2-color-ui-shape-neutral-4)"><td class="w-1/2 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText2" style="font-size:16px">Material</span></td><td class="w-1/2 pl-12 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Bamboo</span></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--tux-v2-color-ui-shape-neutral-4)"><td class="w-1/2 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText2" style="font-size:16px">Feature</span></td><td class="w-1/2 pl-12 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Breathable,Wrinkle resistant,Durable,Cooling,Soft,Fade resistant</span></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:none"><td class="w-1/2 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText2" style="font-size:16px">Theme</span></td><td class="w-1/2 pl-12 text-left align-top pb-12"><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Solid</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="text-color-UITextInfo P1-Regular cursor-pointer mt-12">View more</div></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Product description</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="relative rounded-8 mediaContainer-fk0Sf6"><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-[442px]" style="max-height:442px"><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">BAMBOO SHEETS</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> - Crafted from bamboo, these all-natural luxury sheets provide a much longer life span than bamboo blend sheets, microfiber, or cotton sheets. Bamboo sheets have a history of retaining their softness for years of cozy comfort. </span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">SUPER COOLING BAMBOO SHEETS</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> - Bamboo sheets will keep you comfortable and cool all night long. Bamboo sheets are great if you’re a hot sleeper, suffer from night sweats, or have hot flashes because of their breathability. </span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">DEEP POCKET SHEETS</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> - Many mattresses are quite deep these days and those mattresses require sheets with deep pockets to match. Bamboo sheets are a perfect complement for these mattresses due to the fabric’s flexibility. Our bamboo sheets fit mattresses up to 16 inches deep and still fit great on mattresses less than 16 inches.</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">SUPER SOFT &amp; LIGHTWEIGHT</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> - These luxury bamboo bed sheets are light, breathable, and silky soft. Soft and cooling bamboo sheets provide a luxurious night’s sleep. Instead of being a bamboo blend with heavy fabrics such as cotton, microfiber, or even worse polyester these soft bamboo sheets are made from high-quality natural bamboo fibers.</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">MOISTURE WICKING SHEETS</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> - Bamboo sheets are great moisture-wicking sheets because bamboo fabrics are hygroscopic, meaning they absorb moisture and move it away from your body. This quality lends to the comfort and breathability of bamboo sheets. The moisture-wicking properties of these soft bamboo sheets deliver a dry, fresh, and friendly night’s sleep. </span></div></div></div><div class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full mt-20"><span class="Headline-Semibold text-color-UIText1 rounded-8 background-color-UIShapeNeutral4 px-24 py-13">View more</span></div><div class="absolute bottom-60 left-0 right-0 h-60 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-transparent pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%, #FFFFFF 100%"></div></div></div></div><div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Video</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="relative flex justify-center items-center w-full mediaContainer-fk0Sf6"><video class="portraitMedia-yXA1Bm rounded-12" controls="" preload="none" src="https://v16m-default.tiktokcdn-us.com/6eceba4e15cbb816e3fd9b1ad7cc151c/6aec82d3/video/tos/useast5/tos-useast5-v-afa798-tx/oAqUIpiBvBfBo29Qy122qmBEjCiMvkhWVPASox/?a=0&amp;bti=PDM8QDI2M2A%3D&amp;&amp;bt=501&amp;ft=GS-jnInz7ThSBH5GXq8Zmo&amp;mime_type=video_mp4&amp;rc=OGg7NjQ5PDRlO2loZDxpO0BpajlwdXA5cjpmZDMzZzVnNEBfYDExMF4wNjQxNDQtYy9eYSMtZW4tMmRzaG9hMC1kMi9zcw%3D%3D&amp;vvpl=1&amp;l=2026110507203918B19090AE0E50007FCC&amp;btag=e00088000" poster="https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-p-afa798-tx/o4fJeNG2ClVOGLmrqGMfhBIUMIbtFeDQIxYyIR~tplv-noop.image?dr=12525&amp;refresh_token=3f370928&amp;x-expires=1793884883&amp;x-signature=0vzlV6xxImoYWSllZxp6ag1p2Wc%3D&amp;t=9276707c&amp;ps=14f1eb3e&amp;shp=9e36835a&amp;shcp=6ce186a1&amp;idc=useast5&amp;VideoID=v12d52gd0030darck7vog65m0rqmh60g" width="576" height="1024"></video><div class="absolute w-33 h-33 rounded-16 flex justify-center items-center text-color-UIImageOverlayWhite background-color-UIImageOverlayBlackA25 z-10"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="15px"><path d="M45.08 25.84a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 0-3.67 4.82 4.82 0 0 0-1.75-1.91c-.7-.5-1.64-1.04-2.78-1.69L18.87 6.14c-1.12-.65-2.06-1.19-2.83-1.54a4.82 4.82 0 0 0-2.52-.55 4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.16 1.84c-.53.73-.7 1.6-.78 2.45-.08.85-.08 1.93-.08 3.22v24.88c0 1.3 0 2.37.08 3.22.08.86.25 1.73.78 2.45a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.16 1.84c.9.1 1.74-.2 2.52-.55.77-.35 1.7-.89 2.83-1.53l21.68-12.44c1.14-.65 2.08-1.2 2.78-1.69.7-.5 1.38-1.08 1.75-1.9Z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Introduction</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="text-color-UIText1 break-words leading-relaxed" style="font-size:16px">The CGK Bamboo Cooling Sheet Set offers a premium sleep experience crafted entirely from natural bamboo fibers. These sheets provide a soft, silky texture that stays smooth and comfortable for years, perfectly suited for those who value durability alongside comfort. Designed to enhance breathability and coolness, the sheets help regulate temperature, making them ideal for hot sleepers or anyone prone to night sweats. The moisture-wicking properties of bamboo fabric move moisture away from the body, ensuring a dry, fresh night&#x27;s rest. With deep pockets designed to fit mattresses up to 16 inches, this set also accommodates many modern bed sizes while ensuring a snug fit. Available in king size and in a rich navy blue color, this sheet set combines practicality with elegant simplicity. Easy to care for, the sheets are machine washable, offering convenience without compromising quality. This bamboo sheet set is an excellent choice for anyone seeking a cool, soft, and breathable bedding option that lasts.</div><div class="flex items-center mt-16 cursor-pointer text-color-UIText3"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="16px"><path d="M24 6a18 18 0 1 0 0 36 18 18 0 0 0 0-36ZM2 24a22 22 0 1 1 44 0 22 22 0 0 1-44 0Zm25-8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm-4 6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V23a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2Z"></path></svg><span class="P3-Regular ml-4">This information is AI generated</span></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Question and answer</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-16"><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What material are the CGK Bamboo Cooling Sheets made from?
A:They are made from 100% rayon derived from natural bamboo fibers.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What mattress depth do these bamboo sheets fit?
A:They fit mattresses up to 16 inches deep.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">Are these bamboo sheets machine washable?
A:Yes, the sheets are machine washable for easy care.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What sizes and colors are available for this bamboo sheet set?
A:The set is available in king size and comes in a navy blue color.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">Do the sheets help with overheating or night sweats?
A:Yes, the breathable and moisture-wicking bamboo fabric helps keep sleepers cool and dry.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center mt-16 cursor-pointer text-color-UIText3"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="16px"><path d="M24 6a18 18 0 1 0 0 36 18 18 0 0 0 0-36ZM2 24a22 22 0 1 1 44 0 22 22 0 0 1-44 0Zm25-8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm-4 6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V23a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2Z"></path></svg><span class="P3-Regular ml-4">This information is AI generated</span></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Safety &amp; compliance</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-20"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Semibold"><span style="font-weight:600;color:#000000">Seller information</span></div><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Regular flex"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="min-w-0"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Business name: CGK Holdings, Inc.</span></div></div><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Regular flex"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="min-w-0"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Business address: 600 Cleveland Street,Clearwater,Florida,33755</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div c