eight=1","font":{"font_weight":2,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#007B7B"}}}}],"compliance":{"title":"Seller information","contents":["Business name: CGK Holdings, Inc.","Business address: 600 Cleveland Street,Clearwater,Florida,33755"],"rich_title":{"template":"Seller information","text_attribute":{"font":{"font_weight":2,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#000000"}}},"rich_contents":[{"template":"Business name: CGK Holdings, Inc.","text_attribute":{"font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#000000"}}},{"template":"Business address: 600 Cleveland Street,Clearwater,Florida,33755","text_attribute":{"font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#000000"}}}]},"legit_warnings":[],"button_area_id":"default","page_sections":["head_image","waist_banner","top_margin","lock_up","lock_up_bottom_divider","sku_selection_v2_group","product_highlights_top_divider","product_highlights","first_screen_divider","logistic","creator_video","creator_video_bottom_divider","seller_above_review","shop_recommend_above_review","shop_recommend_above_review_bottom_divider","complementary_recommendation","complementary_recommendation_bottom_divider","review","review_bottom_divider","questions","questions_bottom_divider","description_title","about_this_product_description","about_this_product_details_top_line","about_this_product_details","about_this_product_compliance_top_line","about_this_product_compliance","about_this_product_compliance_bottom_divider"]},"aigc_info":{"long_text":"The CGK Bamboo Cooling Sheet Set offers a premium sleep experience crafted entirely from natural bamboo fibers. These sheets provide a soft, silky texture that stays smooth and comfortable for years, perfectly suited for those who value durability alongside comfort. Designed to enhance breathability and coolness, the sheets help regulate temperature, making them ideal for hot sleepers or anyone prone to night sweats. The moisture-wicking properties of bamboo fabric move moisture away from the body, ensuring a dry, fresh night's rest. With deep pockets designed to fit mattresses up to 16 inches, this set also accommodates many modern bed sizes while ensuring a snug fit. Available in king size and in a rich navy blue color, this sheet set combines practicality with elegant simplicity. Easy to care for, the sheets are machine washable, offering convenience without compromising quality. This bamboo sheet set is an excellent choice for anyone seeking a cool, soft, and breathable bedding option that lasts.","faq":"Q:What material are the CGK Bamboo Cooling Sheets made from?\nA:They are made from 100% rayon derived from natural bamboo fibers.\n\nQ:What mattress depth do these bamboo sheets fit?\nA:They fit mattresses up to 16 inches deep.\n\nQ:Are these bamboo sheets machine washable?\nA:Yes, the sheets are machine washable for easy care.\n\nQ:What sizes and colors are available for this bamboo sheet set?\nA:The set is available in king size and comes in a navy blue color.\n\nQ:Do the sheets help with overheating or night sweats?\nA:Yes, the breathable and moisture-wicking bamboo fabric helps keep sleepers cool and dry.","bullet_points":"• Made from 100% natural rayon derived from bamboo for lasting softness\n• Cooling and breathable fabric ideal for hot sleepers and night sweats\n• Fits mattresses up to 16 inches deep with flexible deep pockets\n• Lightweight, silky soft texture provides luxurious comfort\n• Machine washable for easy maintenance","aigc_title":"CGK Bamboo Cooling Sheet Set - 100% Rayon from Bamboo, Breathable, King, Navy Blue","aigc_description":"Experience cool, soft comfort all night with CGK's 100% bamboo cooling sheet set. Breathable, moisture-wicking, and machine washable for easy care.","aigc_keywords":[{"keyword":"bamboo cooling sheets"},{"keyword":"breathable bamboo sheet set"},{"keyword":"100% rayon bamboo sheets"},{"keyword":"moisture-wicking bed sheets"},{"keyword":"lightweight bamboo sheets king size"},{"ke